  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Poco despu&eacute;s de las 18 horas de este mi&eacute;rcoles se ha declarado un ncendio en Reciclados Collado (Recicol) en </span><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#4267b2\">el&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">pol&iacute;gono industrial El Colador de Onda, junto al aparcamiento de Salones Princesa. Todo el personal ha sido evacuado sin sufrir da&ntilde;os. </span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680149.jpg\" alt=\"p1680149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680151.jpg\" alt=\"p1680151\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680153.jpg\" alt=\"p1680153\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680154.jpg\" alt=\"p1680154\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680155.jpg\" alt=\"p1680155\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680157.jpg\" alt=\"p1680157\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680158.jpg\" alt=\"p1680158\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/incendireciclatscollado/p1680160.jpg\" alt=\"p1680160\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/in